<h5>How to show shortcuts</h5>
<p>In menus and other places, Windows joins the key combinations/​shortcuts with a plus, but Apple just glues them together:</p>
<ul>
        <li>Windows: Shift+A, Ctrl+Shift+G, Ctrl+F11, Alt+Enter</li>
        <li>Mac: ⇧A, ⌃⇧G, ⌘F11, ⌥⏎</li>
      </ul>
